# Api-Application Programming Interface and it is a way for 2 software applications to communicate with each other, so we can also say that api allows frontend and backend to communicate with each other by sending requests and receiving responses

# Rest Api-Representational state transfer in which 2 software communicates with each other using HTTP requests and response which is commonly uses HTTP methods like-get,put,post and delete

# FastAPI is a modern Python web framework used to build APIs quickly and efficiently and also it follows python based structure and also generates automatic api document support by which we can easily test api,also supports async which flast and django do not supports async processing and it is very fast as compared to Django and flask and fast api automatically supports data validation

# Route-It is a relationship between URL path and a page or component that should be displayed, for example-/cart defines the Cart Page and /orders defines the order page

# How to run python file-python -m uvicorn main:app --reload